129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (The 2026 Refugee Protection Monitoring exercise was implemented by Harikar NGO in Duhok Governorate and Zakho Independent Administration with UNHCR support. The exercise combined household assessments \(HH assessments\), Key Informant Interviews \(KIIs\), and Focus Group Discussions \(FGDs\) to strengthen the evidence base on protection conditions, access to services, emerging risks and community perspectives.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (Against the agreed target of 230 household, 248 household assessments were completed, representing 107.83% of target. The sampling frame provided by UNHCR comprised 484 households, of which \(51.2%\) were interviewed. In addition, all 8 planned KIIs and all 4 planned FGDs were completed.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
