135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (The 2026 exercise can be described as a consolidated monitoring assessment intended to provide a baseline snapshot following operational changes over the past two years, and also to inform 2027 planning. Its objectives include assessing current protection needs, measuring the impact of operational changes, identifying emerging risks and coping strategies, and re-establishing an evidence base for prioritization, advocacy and future programming.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (The methodology uses three complementary tools to collect information on a variety of protection themes via KoBo; household-level assessments, KIIs and FGDs:)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
