/E (The sampling list received was heavily concentrated in Sumel with \(302 records\) reflecting the presence of the two large refugee camps \(Domiz 1 & 2\). This was followed by Zakho \(69 records\) and Bardarash \(62 records\). The completed interviews followed a similar pattern, with 158 interviews in Sumel.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 110 0 R
